// _protocol v1 — model-facing fragments shared by every model request (TECH_PLAN §4.11).
// A group file whose name starts with "_" is a fragment group: it defines no system/user
// prompt, only named fragments rendered by whichever provider's request mapper is active. Under
// the eval gate and the prompt changelog like any prompt (.claude/rules/ai-layer.md: never
// inline prompt strings).

// The description of the one forced tool; v.task is the prompt name.
tool_description(v) ::= <<
Return the structured result of the <v.task> task.
>>

// The tool result that follows a rejected tool input on the repair retry; v.errors is the list
// of validation messages.
repair(v) ::= <<
The tool input was rejected: <v.errors; separator="; ">. Call the tool again with an input that matches its schema exactly.
>>
